  </p>

  <h2>Enrollment</h2>
  <p>
    Enrollment in MDC2 and MDC3 is confirmed after direct communication with our team and receipt
    of the applicable program fee. Program fees, duration, and inclusions are as described on
    this website at the time of enrollment, or as otherwise confirmed with you in writing.
  </p>

  <h2>Payments &amp; Refunds</h2>
