    reproduced, resold, or redistributed without our written permission.
  </p>

  <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the maximum extent permitted by law, Money Door FX Academy is not liable for any trading
    losses, indirect damages, or losses arising from your use of the information or strategies
    taught in our programs. Trading is inherently risky, and outcomes depend on your own
    decisions and market conditions outside of our control.
  </p>

  <h2>Governing Law</h2>
  <p>These terms are governed by the laws of India, with courts in Tamil Nadu having jurisdiction.</p>

  <h2>Changes to These Terms</h2>
  <p>
    We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of our website or programs after
